{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807110/extras/ceadf5ba917b4824245a5b5320a10846.avif?t=1770567135\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><strong>The adventure takes place in a steampunk universe, within a Great Clock (thought as Big Ben), an unpretentious building where scientific activity takes place, as part of research into new energy sources... or so the story goes.</strong><br>You take on the role of an automaton, limited to moving, running and interacting, accompanied by a calculator-being that will stick with you until the end of the adventure.<br>The building is labyrinthine, forcing you to make numerous trips back and forth in order to progress through the story, a classic piece of architecture.<br>The puzzles are simple, all you have to do is find notes containing activation codes for generators.<br>The adventure is meant to be short, but it will take longer to uncover all that Clocked hides.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807110/extras/d41cf1a6b3884b461fb962d249e2524b.avif?t=1770567135\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><strong>The game is simple on the surface, but will be more difficult in this other dimension.</strong><br>You'll have to use your dexterity to avoid the symbiotic clusters that will surprise you during your health walk.<br>This is an important dimension, as it will give you access to areas that are normally inaccessible...think about it!<br>You'll be juggling between the &quot;default&quot; world and this one to navigate the Great Clock.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807110/extras/cf69592b0b31abece4fa921044e43d1a.avif?t=1770567135\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><strong>A classic adventure, but a story full of mystery, unclear on the surface.</strong><br>There's a lot to discover in Clocked, and the adventure revolves more around exploration than escape from the Great Clock.<br>There are several endings, each offering a unique experience, packed with information about the history surrounding the Great Clock.<br>Don't forget to chat with your calculator friend, he's very chatty.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Work Finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2807110/c14c43de62669c016dcdfff45729e2abe1b0616a.jpg"},{"name":"Machine Launch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2807110/5792a7b90d206542c57af62ce9c959d9596260f6.jpg"},{"name":"End of Session","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2807110/2f19a49fd94ec3422e230e9407b7a2bd202bdb05.jpg"},{"name":"Silence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2807110/cf955446c9175b74d220eae677d800ef2280d517.jpg"},{"name":"Change Disc","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2807110/f9cc151898aef500c7f1339d8d5ad8032f510b38.jpg"},{"name":"Change Frequency","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2807110/e00cee0ef783b967d2e42e8bb6c95beba331cc28.jpg"},{"name":"I know Everything","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2807110/c037207417754aaf0dfb31ed075b5718a7862b43.jpg"},{"name":"Receive Loud and Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2807110/9a0b1ab5f60d3765a681d31509239d05299e614d.jpg"},{"name":"FUNNY !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2807110/3648eaacba0fef17793259d224fac78b07ac74a4.jpg"},{"name":"What an Adventure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2807110/eabd7cdff999e33d4c29892f94a747a712394c87.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.s